# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep your DATA out of GitHub.
# The portal stores everything in your browser, not in this repo -
# but backups and exports you download contain that data, so they
# must never be committed. (Note: the web "Upload files" button on
# github.com ignores this file - only drag in index.html, README.md
# and .gitignore. This file protects you when you use git or
# GitHub Desktop.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Backup files (the portal names them like WDD_OPS_AutoBackup_17-11-2026.JSON)
*.json
*.JSON
*.bak
*Backup*
*backup*

# Exports and generated forms
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.zip
~$*

# Operating system / editor clutter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
